Problem: After a fair die with faces numbered 1 to 6 is rolled, the number on the top face is $x$. Which of the following is most likely?
(A) $x$ is greater than 2
(B) $x$ equals 4 or 5
(C) $x$ is even
(D) $x$ is less than 3
